{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54347","headline":"感应诗五十六字 · 张瑜","name":"感应诗五十六字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣女嘉祥推感应，葬仪伤恸九般情。\n林中愁听黄莺啭，月下惟闻白鹿鸣。\n慧日流光重抱戴，瑞云频绕（《山右石刻丛编》作「现」）五花成。\n莫言此地无（《山右石刻丛编》作「栽」）松柏，刊石留将记姓名。\n（《山西通志》卷九三《金石记》五录张瑜撰《大唐广平郡乐公之二女灵圣通化合葬先代父母有五瑞记》附。\n此则承张忱石先生录示。\n又见胡聘之《山右石刻丛编》卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张瑜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}